    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a cadet Explorer in the Spacenoid Arcology Group, out on your first assignment. After a catastrophic hyperspace jump gone wrong, you crash-land in the middle of a mysterious asteroid field. But this isn\u2019t just any asteroid field \u2014 it was once home to the Spacenoid Arcology Group (SAG), an ambitious project designed to create self-sustaining cities in the depths of space.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spacenoid Arcology Group was humanity's attempt at building &quot;living system&quot; arcologies \u2014 self-sufficient habitats meant to support life indefinitely, cut off from the outside world. But something went wrong. The arcologies now lie abandoned, and the truth behind their failure is buried beneath layers of puzzles, hidden pathways, and cryptic messages.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s up to you to explore the ruins, piece together the story, and uncover the fate of the Spacenoids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D Platforming</strong> \u2013 Master tight controls and fluid movement as you navigate complex environments.<br><br><strong>Collectibles to Find</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Hunt down hidden collectibles and lore pieces to uncover the fate of the Spacenoid Arcology Group through environmental storytelling and cryptic clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Low-Poly Aesthetic</strong> \u2013 A clean, minimalist art style that highlights the beauty and isolation of deep space.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover the Truth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore derelict stations, unlock hidden paths, and discover the truth behind the Spacenoids' downfall. The fate of humanity\u2019s most ambitious project lies in your hands.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a cadet Explorer in the Spacenoid Arcology Group, out on your first assignment. After a catastrophic hyperspace jump gone wrong, you crash-land in the middle of a mysterious asteroid field. But this isn\u2019t just any asteroid field \u2014 it was once home to the Spacenoid Arcology Group (SAG), an ambitious project designed to create self-sustaining cities in the depths of space.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spacenoid Arcology Group was humanity's attempt at building &quot;living system&quot; arcologies \u2014 self-sufficient habitats meant to support life indefinitely, cut off from the outside world. But something went wrong. The arcologies now lie abandoned, and the truth behind their failure is buried beneath layers of puzzles, hidden pathways, and cryptic messages.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s up to you to explore the ruins, piece together the story, and uncover the fate of the Spacenoids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D Platforming</strong> \u2013 Master tight controls and fluid movement as you navigate complex environments.<br><br><strong>Collectibles to Find</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Hunt down hidden collectibles and lore pieces to uncover the fate of the Spacenoid Arcology Group through environmental storytelling and cryptic clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Low-Poly Aesthetic</strong> \u2013 A clean, minimalist art style that highlights the beauty and isolation of deep space.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover the Truth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore derelict stations, unlock hidden paths, and discover the truth behind the Spacenoids' downfall. The fate of humanity\u2019s most ambitious project lies in your hands.</p>",
